{"$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/guitaripod/wwdc-sessions/master/schema/transcript.schema.json", "id": "wwdc2019-246", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2019/246", "wordCount": 2089, "segments": [{"start": 8.0, "text": "Hi, everybody."}, {"start": 9.0, "text": "I'm Giovanni Tarducci, from the"}, {"start": 10.0, "text": "System UI SpringBoard team."}, {"start": 12.0, "text": "And today, I'm happy to tell you"}, {"start": 14.0, "text": "everything about managing your"}, {"start": 15.0, "text": "windows on iPadOS."}, {"start": 17.0, "text": "We are introducing three new"}, {"start": 19.0, "text": "API's, to do just that."}, {"start": 21.0, "text": "To respectively activate,"}, {"start": 22.0, "text": "refresh, or destroy any of your"}, {"start": 24.0, "text": "scene sessions."}, {"start": 26.0, "text": "But let's jump right into a demo"}, {"start": 28.0, "text": "of these API's at work, in an"}, {"start": 29.0, "text": "app we've been prototyping."}, {"start": 38.0, "text": "Okay. We call it Clown Town."}, {"start": 42.0, "text": "And it's a great new way to get"}, {"start": 43.0, "text": "a clown for your party."}, {"start": 45.0, "text": "It opens to a full-screen map,"}, {"start": 47.0, "text": "showing all the clowns in my"}, {"start": 48.0, "text": "network."}, {"start": 49.0, "text": "I can tap on any of their"}, {"start": 51.0, "text": "markers, to see more about them."}, {"start": 54.0, "text": "The implementation is straight"}, {"start": 56.0, "text": "forward, as well."}, {"start": 57.0, "text": "The detail view controller just"}, {"start": 59.0, "text": "knows how to show a clown with a"}, {"start": 60.0, "text": "given ID."}, {"start": 61.0, "text": "While the map view controller,"}, {"start": 63.0, "text": "delegates everything,"}, {"start": 64.0, "text": "presentation, animation and"}, {"start": 66.0, "text": "gestures to UIKit."}, {"start": 68.0, "text": "Through the presentviewcontroller"}, {"start": 69.0, "text": "animated API."}, {"start": 71.0, "text": "Well, with the enhancement to"}, {"start": 72.0, "text": "multitasking, we can push this"}, {"start": 74.0, "text": "delegation model to the next"}, {"start": 76.0, "text": "level. And gain powerful new features"}, {"start": 78.0, "text": "for free."}, {"start": 79.0, "text": "Taxes may apply at checkout."}, {"start": 82.0, "text": "So, we did start by adding an"}, {"start": 83.0, "text": "\"open in new window\" button in"}, {"start": 85.0, "text": "the data view."}, {"start": 87.0, "text": "So, that all our users are going"}, {"start": 89.0, "text": "to be able to discover this"}, {"start": 90.0, "text": "great new feature."}, {"start": 91.0, "text": "When tapped, we call new request"}, {"start": 93.0, "text": "scene session activation API, to"}, {"start": 96.0, "text": "open this clown in an auxiliary"}, {"start": 98.0, "text": "dedicated window."}, {"start": 100.0, "text": "Let's do that."}, {"start": 101.0, "text": "Already, I can keep browsing my"}, {"start": 103.0, "text": "map and checking out and"}, {"start": 104.0, "text": "comparing other clowns."}, {"start": 106.0, "text": "But not only that, we can now"}, {"start": 108.0, "text": "have the whole system working"}, {"start": 110.0, "text": "for us."}, {"start": 111.0, "text": "We can resize the windows, move"}, {"start": 114.0, "text": "them around."}, {"start": 115.0, "text": "Keep opening new windows."}, {"start": 118.0, "text": "And the one I had on my side, is"}, {"start": 119.0, "text": "now in its own space in the"}, {"start": 120.0, "text": "switcher."}, {"start": 121.0, "text": "Now, I can make this one a slide"}, {"start": 123.0, "text": "over, move it around, stash it."}, {"start": 126.0, "text": "And maybe opening another couple"}, {"start": 129.0, "text": "details, Crusty and a last one,"}, {"start": 135.0, "text": "Mr. Happy here."}, {"start": 138.0, "text": "Okay, so, with the swipe app, I"}, {"start": 140.0, "text": "can check out my whole stack of"}, {"start": 142.0, "text": "slide overs."}, {"start": 143.0, "text": "And I can even quickly swipe"}, {"start": 145.0, "text": "through them all, just like"}, {"start": 146.0, "text": "that. I can even go back from being a"}, {"start": 148.0, "text": "slide over, to being next to the"}, {"start": 150.0, "text": "map again."}, {"start": 151.0, "text": "Now, let's pause for a second."}, {"start": 152.0, "text": "We did achieve all of these,"}, {"start": 154.0, "text": "again, by delegating,"}, {"start": 155.0, "text": "presentation, animation and"}, {"start": 157.0, "text": "more, to the system."}, {"start": 159.0, "text": "So far, through the single"}, {"start": 160.0, "text": "request scene session activation"}, {"start": 163.0, "text": "API."}, {"start": 164.0, "text": "Now, I only now noticed that Mr."}, {"start": 165.0, "text": "Happy here has got a one-star"}, {"start": 167.0, "text": "rating."}, {"start": 168.0, "text": "Probably not a good clown."}, {"start": 170.0, "text": "So, let's get rid of him and his"}, {"start": 171.0, "text": "window, through new request"}, {"start": 173.0, "text": "scene session destruction API,"}, {"start": 175.0, "text": "which I'm calling for the upper"}, {"start": 176.0, "text": "right down button here."}, {"start": 178.0, "text": "Let's do that. And he's gone for good."}, {"start": 181.0, "text": "Now, I remembered the one I had"}, {"start": 182.0, "text": "in my switcher, had a five-star"}, {"start": 183.0, "text": "rating."}, {"start": 184.0, "text": "So, let me open her again."}, {"start": 187.0, "text": "Notice how she wasn't"}, {"start": 189.0, "text": "duplicated."}, {"start": 190.0, "text": "This is Clown Town policy."}, {"start": 191.0, "text": "And it's easily enforced, just"}, {"start": 193.0, "text": "by asking the request session"}, {"start": 195.0, "text": "activation API to activate and"}, {"start": 196.0, "text": "existing session instead of a"}, {"start": 198.0, "text": "new one."}, {"start": 199.0, "text": "I can even track her"}, {"start": 201.0, "text": "availability."}, {"start": 202.0, "text": "She was checked and found"}, {"start": 203.0, "text": "available, as I can tell from"}, {"start": 205.0, "text": "the green navigation bar."}, {"start": 206.0, "text": "Also, an instant book button did"}, {"start": 209.0, "text": "appear on the left side."}, {"start": 211.0, "text": "If her availability were to"}, {"start": 213.0, "text": "change, I will get a"}, {"start": 214.0, "text": "notification."}, {"start": 215.0, "text": "I will update this UI to have"}, {"start": 216.0, "text": "the navigation bar now in red."}, {"start": 219.0, "text": "And I will call the new request"}, {"start": 221.0, "text": "scene session refresh API, to"}, {"start": 223.0, "text": "update, beside other things, the"}, {"start": 226.0, "text": "snapshot of this UI, for it to"}, {"start": 228.0, "text": "be represented in the switchers."}, {"start": 230.0, "text": "But I did not decide yet."}, {"start": 232.0, "text": "So, let us instead start"}, {"start": 235.0, "text": "tracking them all, just like"}, {"start": 237.0, "text": "this."}, {"start": 238.0, "text": "Say now that I do background the"}, {"start": 240.0, "text": "app, to do something else."}, {"start": 242.0, "text": "Maybe recommend this app to my"}, {"start": 243.0, "text": "friends."}, {"start": 244.0, "text": "And show the current collection"}, {"start": 246.0, "text": "I have right now."}, {"start": 247.0, "text": "But I'm getting notifications"}, {"start": 249.0, "text": "already. A bunch of them are no longer"}, {"start": 251.0, "text": "available."}, {"start": 252.0, "text": "I cannot recall their names."}, {"start": 253.0, "text": "So, let me instead use app"}, {"start": 255.0, "text": "expose, to glance at all my"}, {"start": 257.0, "text": "windows at once."}, {"start": 258.0, "text": "And there we go."}, {"start": 259.0, "text": "Their snapshots were updated,"}, {"start": 261.0, "text": "which is great."}, {"start": 262.0, "text": "Because I can manage my window"}, {"start": 263.0, "text": "right here and there."}, {"start": 265.0, "text": "A couple of swipe ups and I'm"}, {"start": 267.0, "text": "done. Looks like these clowns are"}, {"start": 268.0, "text": "running out fast."}, {"start": 269.0, "text": "So, let me go ahead and book the"}, {"start": 271.0, "text": "great BuBu LuBu, so we can go"}, {"start": 273.0, "text": "back to our party."}, {"start": 275.0, "text": "Oops, see you later Clown Town."}, {"start": 279.0, "text": "Okay, so..."}, {"start": 282.0, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 285.0, "text": "So, let's check out the API's,"}, {"start": 286.0, "text": "activating a session."}, {"start": 288.0, "text": "First of all, you activate a"}, {"start": 290.0, "text": "session only in response to"}, {"start": 292.0, "text": "direct and local user"}, {"start": 293.0, "text": "interaction."}, {"start": 295.0, "text": "The user has to touch the screen"}, {"start": 297.0, "text": "for it to happen."}, {"start": 299.0, "text": "And you do so by calling the new"}, {"start": 301.0, "text": "request scene session activation"}, {"start": 302.0, "text": "API on UI application."}, {"start": 304.0, "text": "To either activate an existing"}, {"start": 306.0, "text": "session or a new one."}, {"start": 308.0, "text": "Now, in Clown Town, when we"}, {"start": 310.0, "text": "first launched, UIApplication"}, {"start": 312.0, "text": "had just one open session."}, {"start": 314.0, "text": "The one with our map"}, {"start": 315.0, "text": "configuration."}, {"start": 317.0, "text": "All in just window, displaying"}, {"start": 319.0, "text": "our whole view hierarchy."}, {"start": 321.0, "text": "When the open a new window"}, {"start": 323.0, "text": "button was pressed, through"}, {"start": 325.0, "text": "delegation, the detail view"}, {"start": 326.0, "text": "controller gets to the map view"}, {"start": 328.0, "text": "controller, which is presenting"}, {"start": 329.0, "text": "it."}, {"start": 330.0, "text": "And the map view controller"}, {"start": 331.0, "text": "calls this method that we added"}, {"start": 333.0, "text": "on our application delegate."}, {"start": 336.0, "text": "Here, since we have the no"}, {"start": 338.0, "text": "duplicate policy, we check for"}, {"start": 340.0, "text": "any existing session for this"}, {"start": 341.0, "text": "given clown."}, {"start": 343.0, "text": "Now, on first launch, we won't"}, {"start": 344.0, "text": "find any."}, {"start": 345.0, "text": "So, we're going to end up"}, {"start": 346.0, "text": "passing nil here, at runtime."}, {"start": 348.0, "text": "Pass nil here, to this"}, {"start": 349.0, "text": "parameter, requests a brand-new"}, {"start": 351.0, "text": "scene session to be created."}, {"start": 353.0, "text": "We then create a userActivity"}, {"start": 355.0, "text": "for this clown."}, {"start": 356.0, "text": "And the userActivity is going to"}, {"start": 358.0, "text": "be given back to us by UIKit,"}, {"start": 361.0, "text": "later on along the delegate"}, {"start": 363.0, "text": "chain, as we'll see."}, {"start": 365.0, "text": "The options objects, let's me"}, {"start": 367.0, "text": "specify a requesting scene,"}, {"start": 369.0, "text": "which is meant to be the one"}, {"start": 370.0, "text": "where this request was user"}, {"start": 372.0, "text": "initiated."}, {"start": 373.0, "text": "The system uses this information"}, {"start": 375.0, "text": "to avoid replacing the"}, {"start": 377.0, "text": "requestingScene with the"}, {"start": 378.0, "text": "activated one."}, {"start": 380.0, "text": "And for other navigation"}, {"start": 381.0, "text": "purposes."}, {"start": 382.0, "text": "We can now call the API."}, {"start": 385.0, "text": "The new window is shown."}, {"start": 386.0, "text": "And alongside, a new session"}, {"start": 388.0, "text": "hierarchy has been created."}, {"start": 390.0, "text": "As I mentioned, there are two"}, {"start": 392.0, "text": "key delicate methods you"}, {"start": 394.0, "text": "definitely want to implement, in"}, {"start": 395.0, "text": "order for your app to have a say"}, {"start": 397.0, "text": "in what actually gets created."}, {"start": 399.0, "text": "And how it gets configured."}, {"start": 401.0, "text": "So, let's step back and go back"}, {"start": 403.0, "text": "to when we called the API."}, {"start": 405.0, "text": "As soon as we do so, UIKit"}, {"start": 409.0, "text": "creates a brand-new scene"}, {"start": 411.0, "text": "session. And let's you specify a"}, {"start": 413.0, "text": "configuration for it, by calling"}, {"start": 415.0, "text": "configuration for connecting"}, {"start": 416.0, "text": "scene session on your app"}, {"start": 418.0, "text": "delegate. You definitely want to implement"}, {"start": 419.0, "text": "this one."}, {"start": 420.0, "text": "And here, you can inspect the"}, {"start": 422.0, "text": "user activity."}, {"start": 423.0, "text": "Which is given back to you now"}, {"start": 425.0, "text": "through the UI scene connecting"}, {"start": 426.0, "text": "options, to pick a session."}, {"start": 429.0, "text": "In my case, it's the detail"}, {"start": 432.0, "text": "configuration."}, {"start": 434.0, "text": "Now, if your configuration"}, {"start": 435.0, "text": "specifies a storyboard, as I do"}, {"start": 437.0, "text": "recommend."}, {"start": 438.0, "text": "At this point, UIKit is able to"}, {"start": 439.0, "text": "go ahead and create the whole"}, {"start": 441.0, "text": "view hierarchy. And you just need to configure"}, {"start": 443.0, "text": "that."}, {"start": 444.0, "text": "You do so by implementing"}, {"start": 445.0, "text": "scenewillConnectToSession on"}, {"start": 447.0, "text": "your scene delegate."}, {"start": 448.0, "text": "In there again, you'll be able"}, {"start": 450.0, "text": "to find your user activity and"}, {"start": 451.0, "text": "the connecting options."}, {"start": 452.0, "text": "And you configure your window"}, {"start": 454.0, "text": "and view controller hierarchy"}, {"start": 455.0, "text": "for it."}, {"start": 458.0, "text": "Now, that was a new session."}, {"start": 460.0, "text": "What about an existing session?"}, {"start": 462.0, "text": "If the session is still is"}, {"start": 464.0, "text": "existing, we go straight to the"}, {"start": 466.0, "text": "scene delegate."}, {"start": 467.0, "text": "And if the session had been"}, {"start": 469.0, "text": "disconnected in the meantime, we"}, {"start": 470.0, "text": "call sceneWillConnectToSession."}, {"start": 473.0, "text": "But if the scene is still"}, {"start": 474.0, "text": "connected, we'll just go to the"}, {"start": 476.0, "text": "continueUserActivity one."}, {"start": 478.0, "text": "You definitely want to implement"}, {"start": 480.0, "text": "those."}, {"start": 481.0, "text": "To recap, you activate a"}, {"start": 483.0, "text": "session, only in response to"}, {"start": 484.0, "text": "direct user request."}, {"start": 486.0, "text": "To either activate a new or"}, {"start": 488.0, "text": "existing session."}, {"start": 490.0, "text": "And you want to implement your"}, {"start": 492.0, "text": "app and scene delegates methods,"}, {"start": 494.0, "text": "to be able to configure both"}, {"start": 496.0, "text": "session and the window for the"}, {"start": 498.0, "text": "activity at hand."}, {"start": 500.0, "text": "Now, onto refreshing a session."}, {"start": 503.0, "text": "You refresh for user-relevant"}, {"start": 505.0, "text": "updates from your app."}, {"start": 506.0, "text": "A couple of examples."}, {"start": 508.0, "text": "It could be that you have"}, {"start": 510.0, "text": "multiple windows showing and"}, {"start": 512.0, "text": "working on the same assets."}, {"start": 514.0, "text": "And the user may have modified"}, {"start": 516.0, "text": "them from a window or even"}, {"start": 518.0, "text": "another device."}, {"start": 519.0, "text": "And now you want to keep them in"}, {"start": 520.0, "text": "sync. You want to have their"}, {"start": 521.0, "text": "presentation being updated in"}, {"start": 523.0, "text": "these features and more."}, {"start": 525.0, "text": "Or you just fetched new data and"}, {"start": 527.0, "text": "it is available for the user to"}, {"start": 529.0, "text": "be seen."}, {"start": 530.0, "text": "Or you want to update some scene"}, {"start": 532.0, "text": "and session metadata, as we'll"}, {"start": 533.0, "text": "see."}, {"start": 535.0, "text": "You do so by calling at any"}, {"start": 537.0, "text": "time, the requestSceneSessionRefresh API"}, {"start": 540.0, "text": "on UIApplication."}, {"start": 542.0, "text": "By just passing in the session you"}, {"start": 544.0, "text": "wish to be refreshed."}, {"start": 547.0, "text": "Now, what is it actually that"}, {"start": 550.0, "text": "this API affords you to update?"}, {"start": 552.0, "text": "You can update the state"}, {"start": 554.0, "text": "restoration user activity for"}, {"start": 556.0, "text": "the session."}, {"start": 557.0, "text": "You can update the scene"}, {"start": 558.0, "text": "activation conditions."}, {"start": 560.0, "text": "And your UI, which is eventually"}, {"start": 563.0, "text": "going to be captured in a"}, {"start": 564.0, "text": "snapshot, again."}, {"start": 566.0, "text": "As we saw in Clown Town, thanks"}, {"start": 568.0, "text": "to those updated snapshots, the"}, {"start": 570.0, "text": "app felt alive in the switcher."}, {"start": 572.0, "text": "And we were able to confidently"}, {"start": 573.0, "text": "act on the incoming data."}, {"start": 575.0, "text": "Without having to navigate to"}, {"start": 577.0, "text": "each and every session, just to"}, {"start": 579.0, "text": "find out, once connected and"}, {"start": 580.0, "text": "updated, that we didn't even"}, {"start": 582.0, "text": "want them anymore."}, {"start": 583.0, "text": "On an architectural note, you"}, {"start": 587.0, "text": "want to listen for rare model"}, {"start": 588.0, "text": "changes for which you want to"}, {"start": 590.0, "text": "call the API."}, {"start": 591.0, "text": "Both in the interested view"}, {"start": 592.0, "text": "controller, as well as in a"}, {"start": 594.0, "text": "long-lived object."}, {"start": 596.0, "text": "Because if the scene is still"}, {"start": 598.0, "text": "connected, either in the"}, {"start": 600.0, "text": "foreground or the background, it"}, {"start": 601.0, "text": "can listen to the notification"}, {"start": 603.0, "text": "itself."}, {"start": 604.0, "text": "And call the API, which is going"}, {"start": 605.0, "text": "to do the right thing"}, {"start": 607.0, "text": "internally."}, {"start": 608.0, "text": "If the scene has been"}, {"start": 610.0, "text": "disconnected though, the view"}, {"start": 612.0, "text": "controller won't be there"}, {"start": 613.0, "text": "anymore."}, {"start": 614.0, "text": "And so, the long-lived object"}, {"start": 615.0, "text": "can step in, figure that out and"}, {"start": 617.0, "text": "call to refresh API in its"}, {"start": 619.0, "text": "place."}, {"start": 621.0, "text": "The scene is going then to be"}, {"start": 622.0, "text": "background connected."}, {"start": 623.0, "text": "And the view controller will"}, {"start": 625.0, "text": "have a chance to update itself."}, {"start": 627.0, "text": "And the snapshot will be"}, {"start": 629.0, "text": "captured."}, {"start": 630.0, "text": "As a summary, you want to"}, {"start": 633.0, "text": "refresh for user relevant"}, {"start": 634.0, "text": "updates from your app."}, {"start": 636.0, "text": "Make your layout time fast, so"}, {"start": 639.0, "text": "that we can quickly capture the"}, {"start": 640.0, "text": "snapshot."}, {"start": 641.0, "text": "And do not rely on it being"}, {"start": 643.0, "text": "executed immediately."}, {"start": 645.0, "text": "The system reserves the ability"}, {"start": 646.0, "text": "to fulfill this request at a"}, {"start": 648.0, "text": "later point in time, if"}, {"start": 649.0, "text": "necessary."}, {"start": 651.0, "text": "Now, destroying a session, also"}, {"start": 653.0, "text": "known as going away with style."}, {"start": 656.0, "text": "You destroy a session for direct"}, {"start": 660.0, "text": "user request."}, {"start": 661.0, "text": "Or if you have a window, which"}, {"start": 662.0, "text": "is an auxiliary window dedicated"}, {"start": 664.0, "text": "to show a piece of data, an"}, {"start": 665.0, "text": "item, that the user already"}, {"start": 667.0, "text": "deleted from somewhere else."}, {"start": 669.0, "text": "Another window or even another"}, {"start": 670.0, "text": "device."}, {"start": 671.0, "text": "You do so by calling, at any"}, {"start": 674.0, "text": "time, the"}, {"start": 675.0, "text": "requestSceneSessionDestruction"}, {"start": 677.0, "text": "API, on UIApplication."}, {"start": 678.0, "text": "Which takes in the session you"}, {"start": 680.0, "text": "wish to be destroyed."}, {"start": 681.0, "text": "As well as an options object."}, {"start": 684.0, "text": "This option lets you specify a"}, {"start": 686.0, "text": "DismissalAnimation."}, {"start": 688.0, "text": "Which the system is going to"}, {"start": 689.0, "text": "take into account, if the scene"}, {"start": 692.0, "text": "happens to be foreground at that"}, {"start": 693.0, "text": "moment."}, {"start": 695.0, "text": "Now, let me be clear, the"}, {"start": 696.0, "text": "session is going to go away and"}, {"start": 698.0, "text": "won't come back."}, {"start": 700.0, "text": "But the animation lets you"}, {"start": 701.0, "text": "acknowledge the user's intent in"}, {"start": 704.0, "text": "getting rid of it."}, {"start": 705.0, "text": "So, which one to pick, then?"}, {"start": 707.0, "text": "The main draft is a great"}, {"start": 709.0, "text": "paradigm."}, {"start": 710.0, "text": "When the main draft is"}, {"start": 711.0, "text": "cancelled, without saving, the"}, {"start": 713.0, "text": "user is explicitly asking for"}, {"start": 715.0, "text": "its content to be destroyed."}, {"start": 717.0, "text": "Which is the common case, when"}, {"start": 718.0, "text": "getting rid of a window, as we"}, {"start": 719.0, "text": "saw in Clown Town."}, {"start": 721.0, "text": "You pick the standard animation,"}, {"start": 722.0, "text": "in these cases, to acknowledge"}, {"start": 725.0, "text": "this intent."}, {"start": 726.0, "text": "When to draft the assent, the"}, {"start": 729.0, "text": "user is not asking for his"}, {"start": 731.0, "text": "content to be destroyed."}, {"start": 733.0, "text": "The session though, will be"}, {"start": 734.0, "text": "destroyed as a side effect of"}, {"start": 735.0, "text": "the user accepting the final"}, {"start": 737.0, "text": "purpose of the session."}, {"start": 739.0, "text": "Which, in the mail case, is"}, {"start": 741.0, "text": "sending the e-mail."}, {"start": 742.0, "text": "In the Clown Town case, was"}, {"start": 743.0, "text": "booking the clown, if you are in"}, {"start": 745.0, "text": "tracking mode."}, {"start": 746.0, "text": "You pick commit to acknowledge"}, {"start": 748.0, "text": "that the final purpose of the"}, {"start": 749.0, "text": "session has been approved by the"}, {"start": 752.0, "text": "user."}, {"start": 754.0, "text": "Now, when the draft is cancelled"}, {"start": 757.0, "text": "and saved, the user again, is"}, {"start": 759.0, "text": "not asking for his content to be"}, {"start": 761.0, "text": "destroyed."}, {"start": 762.0, "text": "The session though, will be"}, {"start": 763.0, "text": "destroyed as a side effect of"}, {"start": 765.0, "text": "the user declining from taking"}, {"start": 767.0, "text": "action right now."}, {"start": 769.0, "text": "You pick decline, in these"}, {"start": 770.0, "text": "cases, to acknowledge that the"}, {"start": 771.0, "text": "final purpose of the session has"}, {"start": 773.0, "text": "not been fulfilled yet."}, {"start": 778.0, "text": "To recap, you destroy a session"}, {"start": 781.0, "text": "in response to user request."}, {"start": 782.0, "text": "Either locally or remotely."}, {"start": 784.0, "text": "And you pick the animation style"}, {"start": 786.0, "text": "to best acknowledge the user's"}, {"start": 787.0, "text": "intent in getting rid of it."}, {"start": 790.0, "text": "To recap, we've seen how through"}, {"start": 792.0, "text": "these new API's, you can empower"}, {"start": 794.0, "text": "your user's actions."}, {"start": 796.0, "text": "And you can delegate complexity"}, {"start": 799.0, "text": "to the system, while gaining"}, {"start": 800.0, "text": "powerful new features, easily"}, {"start": 802.0, "text": "discoverable by all your users."}]}
